<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       PYRELANDS_DEDICATED_GRAZER_1 — how a burrower gets to decide.

       Core's Defs/ThinkTreeDefs/Animal.xml carries
       <li Class="ThinkNode_SubtreesByTag"><insertTag>Animal_PreMain</insertTag></li>,
       and a ThinkTreeDef declaring that insertTag is spliced in there,
       highest insertPriority first. No MayRequire: Animal_PreMain is Core.

       🔑 UNLIKE the fire-hawk/furnace-beast trees, this one carries NO
       species gate at the C# level either — RM_JobGiver_BurrowOnFire's own
       null-modExtension check IS the gate (RM_BurrowOnFireExtension, opt-in
       per race), the same shape CreatureBehaviors' RM_ThinkTree_ShadowFollow
       already uses for the shade-follow mechanism. That is deliberate: a
       second dedicated burrower the biome wants later needs only the
       extension in its own ThingDef, no new ThinkTreeDef and no new C#.

       Animal_PreMain, insertPriority 120 (was Animal_PreWander 56;
       RIMMANDRAKE_FIX_PYRE_ASHWALLOW_SHADE_DASH_BEATS_FIRE_DIVE): a fire
       inside the dive radius outranks every inserted move. At PreWander the
       sun escape (CreatureBehaviors, Animal_PreMain 10) and the animal drink
       (FlowWorks, Animal_PreMain 100) were asked first, so an ashwallow in
       the sun, or thirsty, walked out of its 6-cell radius beside a fire and
       never dived (visit 2). PreMain sits after Downed, Burning, mental
       states, close melee, forced goto, roping and lord duty, and before
       the wild-leave, trained-animal and SatisfyBasicNeeds nodes: a safety
       response. Diving over grazing matches the burn line's nudge,
       which already starts the dive over Ingest and LayDown. The giver
       returns null with no fire near, so no other behaviour changes.
       T_BURROW_BEATS_DASH (selftest_pyrelands_burrow_beats_dash.py) reads
       this order against every rival.
  ======================================================================== -->
  <ThinkTreeDef>
    <defName>RM_BurrowOnFire</defName>
    <insertTag>Animal_PreMain</insertTag>
    <insertPriority>120</insertPriority>
    <thinkRoot Class="ThinkNode_Priority">
      <subNodes>
        <li Class="RimMandrake.Pyrelands.RM_JobGiver_BurrowOnFire" />
      </subNodes>
    </thinkRoot>
  </ThinkTreeDef>

</Defs>
